# Explicit credential files (CRITICAL - DO NOT COMMIT)
docs/dsllc-admin-credentials.md
**/dsllc-admin-credentials.md
**/*admin-credentials*.md
data/credentials.ts
data/credentials.local.ts

# Security alert files (contain credential references)
SECURITY_ALERT_CREDENTIALS_EXPOSED.md
IMMEDIATE_SECURITY_FIX_STEPS.md

# Credential files with real values
